# text = Society has claims on us all ; and I profess myself one of those who consider intervals of recreation and amusement as desirable for everybody I am by no means of the opinion , I assure you that a ball of this kind , given by a young man of character , to respectable people , can have any evil tendency ; and I am so far from objecting to dancing myself , that I shall hope to be honoured with the hands of all my fair cousins in the course of the evening ; and I take this opportunity of soliciting yours , Miss Elizabeth , for the two first dances especially , a preference which I trust my cousin Jane will attribute to the right cause , and not to any disrespect for her I do not imagine his business would have called him away just now , if he had not wanted to avoid a certain gentleman here I dare say you will find him very agreeable Heaven forbid !
