# text = I will read it to you When my brother left us yesterday , he imagined that the business which took him to London might be concluded in three or four days ; but as we are certain it cannot be so , and at the same time convinced that when Charles gets to town he will be in no hurry to leave it again , we have determined on following him thither , that he may not be obliged to spend his vacant hours in a comfortless hotel .
